{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 59,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.79139709472656,
        27.289522171020508,
        328.7294006347656,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "6. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS FOR TREATMENT OF PNEUMONIA",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        320.19158935546875,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "—\t Gentamicin: 7.5 mg/kg IM/IV once a day for at least 5 days",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        75.14679718017578,
        277.7628173828125,
        89.0667953491211
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        91.41151428222656,
        399.15277099609375,
        104.9015121459961
      ],
      "text": "2.\t Ceftriaxone should be used as second line treatment in children with severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        104.41151428222656,
        269.5015869140625,
        117.9015121459961
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia with failure of the first line treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        119.81598663330078,
        229.02288818359375,
        133.73599243164062
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        136.08070373535156,
        399.0828552246094,
        149.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "In making this recommendation, the panel noted that there is good evidence",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        149.08070373535156,
        399.0528869628906,
        162.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "for the superiority of ampicillin and gentamicin over chloramphenicol, as well as",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        162.08070373535156,
        399.04290771484375,
        175.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "major concerns about future supplies. However, there is poor evidence in favour of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        175.08070373535156,
        399.1129455566406,
        188.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "ampicillin and gentamicin as compared to other antibiotics. Although there was no",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        188.08070373535156,
        399.0528869628906,
        201.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "data on the use of ceftriaxone, the panel recognized the need to include ceftriaxone",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        201.08070373535156,
        399.0629577636719,
        214.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "as a second line treatment for children with very severe pneumonia, especially for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        214.08070373535156,
        110.55291748046875,
        227.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "hospital care.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        238.5992889404297,
        231.48292541503906,
        250.58929443359375
      ],
      "text": "6.4.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        254.25389099121094,
        396.8528747558594,
        267.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "Evidence from one systematic review that included two large, RCTs comparing beta-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.2538757324219,
        399.09283447265625,
        280.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "lactam and gentamicin versus chloramphenicol for very severe pneumonia shows",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.2538757324219,
        399.06280517578125,
        293.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "high quality evidence that ampicillin/penicillin and gentamicin reduce clinical",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        293.2538757324219,
        399.0227355957031,
        306.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "failure rates compared to chloramphenicol. There is moderate quality evidence for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.2538757324219,
        399.1128845214844,
        319.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "a trend towards reduced death rates for treatment with ampicillin/penicillin and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.97239685058594,
        319.03387451171875,
        328.8923645019531,
        332.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.12",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.2538757324219,
        334.0503234863281,
        332.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "gentamicin compared to chloramphenicol ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        332.2538757324219,
        399.1114501953125,
        345.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "The first RCT [Duke, 2002] conducted in the highlands of Papua New Guinea",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        345.2538757324219,
        396.82281494140625,
        358.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "(1600-1800 m above sea level) included 1116 children aged 1–59 months with WHO-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        358.2538757324219,
        399.0728454589844,
        371.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "defined very severe pneumonia (modified to include heart failure as a danger sign).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        371.2538757324219,
        396.8128356933594,
        384.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "Enrolled children had a median oxygen saturation of 71%. Five hundred and fifty-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        384.2538757324219,
        399.0630187988281,
        397.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "nine (559) children were treated with 100 mg/kg/day chloramphenicol; 557 children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        397.2538757324219,
        399.11285400390625,
        410.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "were treated with penicillin (200 mg/kg/day) plus gentamicin (7.5 mg/kg/day).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        410.2538757324219,
        399.1028747558594,
        423.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "Duration of treatment was 14 days. Measured outcomes were: death, treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        423.25390625,
        399.03271484375,
        436.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "failure by day 5, and readmission. More children in the penicillin/gentamicin group",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        436.25390625,
        399.08270263671875,
        449.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "required a change of antibiotic (60 versus 49), while 147 (26%) children treated with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        449.25390625,
        399.13299560546875,
        462.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "chloramphenicol and 123 (22%) treated with penicillin and gentamicin had adverse",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        462.25390625,
        399.0228576660156,
        475.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "outcomes (p = 0.11, not significant). Thirty-six children treated with chloramphenicol",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        475.25390625,
        399.1329345703125,
        488.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "and 29 treated with penicillin and gentamicin died (difference not significant). More",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        488.25390625,
        399.11279296875,
        501.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "children treated with chloramphenicol than penicillin and gentamicin represented",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        501.25390625,
        345.4028015136719,
        514.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "with severe pneumonia within 1 month of hospital discharge (p = 0.03).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        514.25390625,
        399.10137939453125,
        527.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "The second RCT [Asghar, 2008] was a multi-country study, with 80% of children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        527.25390625,
        399.0827941894531,
        540.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "residing at sea level. Children aged 2–59 months were enrolled: 479 randomized to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        540.25390625,
        399.0928039550781,
        553.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "receive chloramphenicol (75 mg/kg/day), and 479 randomized to receive amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        553.25390625,
        399.08282470703125,
        566.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "(200 mg/kg/day) and gentamicin (7.5 mg/kg/day). Median oxygen saturation on",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        566.2539672851562,
        399.11285400390625,
        579.7439575195312
      ],
      "text": "admission was higher than for the PNG study (88%). Duration of treatment was 10",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        579.2539672851562,
        399.082763671875,
        592.7439575195312
      ],
      "text": "days. More children in the chloramphenicol group required a change in antibiotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        592.2539672851562,
        399.0628662109375,
        605.7439575195312
      ],
      "text": "(45 versus 26). Measured outcomes were death or treatment failure by days 5, 10, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        605.2539672851562,
        399.0228576660156,
        618.7439575195312
      ],
      "text": "21. More children failed treatment with chloramphenicol at day 5 (16% versus 11%;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        618.2539672851562,
        399.0628356933594,
        631.7439575195312
      ],
      "text": "relative risk 1.43, 95% CI 1.03 to 1.97) and also by days 10 and 21. There was a trend",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.38180541992188,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.66180419921875,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "45",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}